### Get All Product Admin   
GET {{base_url}}?search=&orderBy=name&orderType=asc&page=1&limit=10&categorySlug=&startPrice=&endPrice=&status=ACTIVE
Authorization: Bearer {{token_super_admin}}


### Get Product By ID
GET {{base_url}}/{{product_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token_super_admin}}

### Delete Product By ID
DELETE {{base_url}}/{{product_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token_super_admin}}

### Create product
POST {{base_url}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token_super_admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Minyak Goreng Bimoli",
  "category_slug": "minyak-goreng",
  "unit": "liter",
  "description": "Minyak goreng Bimoli",
  "status": "ACTIVE",
  "variant": "2",
  "variant_detail": [
    {
      "stock": 100,
      "weight": 2000,
